  "releaseNotes": "Initial release with Blazor Interactive Server pages and components for displaying workflow run history, job and step progress, polling countdowns, periodically refreshed execution state, scoped log filtering, ANSI-formatted logs, and retry-from-failure controls. Pipeline Runs includes a Jobs column with individual job status icons, direct links to job logs, descriptive tooltips, screen-reader labels, and running animations that respect reduced-motion preferences.",
